          "changelog": "First release.\n\n- Shows your iPhone's Live Activities on the Car Thing, mirrored from your Mac through the bridgething desktop app.\n- Redraws each activity's lock-screen view natively from the data macOS receives, at the Car Thing's resolution.\n- Ticks timers and progress bars on the device, and rolls changed digits like iOS.\n- Comes to the front when an activity starts, or also when one updates, or never (setting), and returns to the\n  previous app when the last one ends."
